WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.381
It's the end of the school day.

00:00:01.391 --> 00:00:03.703
You're waiting in a long line of cars, watching the clock.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.806
Inside, the office is trying to work out who's arrived, and which

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:07.936
children are going home.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.652
And out there is a teacher, helping everyone along.

00:00:10.862 --> 00:00:13.704
Through the rain, the cold, or another hot afternoon.

00:00:14.105 --> 00:00:17.378
Beside those idling cars, there's exhaust to breathe in, too.

00:00:17.858 --> 00:00:20.140
What if better coordination meant less time standing beside those

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:20.971
tailpipes?

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:22.474
Does this sound familiar?

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.872
That's why we're building DismissalCue.

00:00:25.132 --> 00:00:27.924
To help families and schools stay connected, from the moment a

00:00:27.924 --> 00:00:30.236
parent arrives to the moment a child heads home.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.482
Picture checking in for your children together.

00:00:32.802 --> 00:00:35.664
The school sees who's here, checks pickup permissions, and calls

00:00:35.664 --> 00:00:36.475
the right children.

00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:39.347
Staff still confirm the handoff, in person.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.011
And pickup doesn't have to look the same for every child.

00:00:42.492 --> 00:00:43.733
Soccer on Tuesdays?

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.404
Art club on Thursdays?

00:00:45.664 --> 00:00:47.597
The school sets each child's pickup time.

00:00:47.997 --> 00:00:51.339
Or, before a holiday weekend, it can schedule an earlier dismissal

00:00:51.339 --> 00:00:52.291
for the whole school.

00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:54.895
Parents get clear updates about those plans.

00:00:55.295 --> 00:00:57.397
Staff have a shared picture of what's happening.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.050
And when someone needs help, they know which school office to contact.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.662
It's about less confusion, and better support for the people looking

00:01:04.662 --> 00:01:05.613
after our children.

00:01:06.047 --> 00:01:07.838
Would this make a difference at your school?

00:01:08.679 --> 00:01:12.542
Talk to your principal, your district, or your school board about

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:13.613
DismissalCue.

00:01:14.094 --> 00:01:16.425
Let's make the end of the school day better, together.
